WEBVTT

00:00:21.771 --> 00:00:24.541
Let's go and don't cry, funny

00:00:24.541 --> 00:00:27.477
Give me a dumbass dream, please

00:00:27.477 --> 00:00:29.713
Don't touch me, baby

00:00:29.713 --> 00:00:32.916
Freedom, baby

00:00:32.916 --> 00:00:38.822
I'm elastic, I want to be chained

00:00:38.822 --> 00:00:43.426
Can you feel it? The nonsensical afterimage

00:00:43.426 --> 00:00:55.171
Even the moments of points and lines
disappear after failing to show

00:00:55.171 --> 00:01:00.911
The sad forefront, an empty sensation

00:01:00.911 --> 00:01:06.583
Sweet remnants that tear at my heart

00:01:06.583 --> 00:01:12.255
Scattering Polaroids, gathering paranoia

00:01:12.255 --> 00:01:17.427
I want you to tell me whose turn is next

00:01:17.427 --> 00:01:30.795
If you sleep close to this incomplete
form, you'll understand and see

00:01:38.715 --> 00:01:40.342
Paladins, huh...

00:01:48.825 --> 00:01:54.197
The biogenic processes of the
subject known as Blue are unperturbed.

00:01:54.197 --> 00:01:59.069
It appears he's recovered from
all physical damage using self-repair.

00:01:59.069 --> 00:02:01.304
As for Malek Werner...

00:02:01.304 --> 00:02:03.440
His pupils have remained
fixed for over 6 hours,

00:02:03.440 --> 00:02:07.610
he's lost all brain-stem reflexes,
and auto-respiration has ceased.

00:02:07.610 --> 00:02:11.214
Locked-in syndrome...
A state of complete brain death.

00:02:11.214 --> 00:02:15.986
Isn't there anything you can do?!
Blue's recovered just fine!

00:02:15.986 --> 00:02:19.990
There's too much we don't
know about Amalgam physiology.

00:02:19.990 --> 00:02:23.892
We'll need to verify
our data for a while longer...

00:02:30.133 --> 00:02:33.466
I won't give up!

00:02:56.893 --> 00:02:58.383
Captain?

00:03:14.644 --> 00:03:15.745
Amanda.

00:03:15.745 --> 00:03:18.581
All set here. Ready when you are.

00:03:18.581 --> 00:03:21.277
Got it. I'll be right there.

00:03:22.786 --> 00:03:24.988
I'm sorry to involve you in this.

00:03:24.988 --> 00:03:30.093
It's alright. We don't
agree with the higher-ups either.

00:03:30.093 --> 00:03:33.963
Letting go of Blue now
is simply out of the question.

00:03:33.963 --> 00:03:37.834
Still, are you sure about this?

00:03:37.834 --> 00:03:40.870
If we get caught, you'll get more
than just a dishonorable discharge...

00:03:40.870 --> 00:03:42.105
Doesn't matter.

00:03:42.105 --> 00:03:46.676
We might find a clue to help
Malek, if this analysis goes well.

00:03:46.676 --> 00:03:51.414
Maybe. There's no guarantee.

00:03:51.414 --> 00:03:55.118
That's fine. It's better
than being able to do nothing!

00:03:55.118 --> 00:03:57.587
Now, then. This has been a long time coming,

00:03:57.587 --> 00:04:02.158
but the increase of equipment
and manpower is coming to fruition.

00:04:02.158 --> 00:04:06.029
The newly-formed Squad 3
will be given a new weapon

00:04:06.029 --> 00:04:07.764
and meet up with your squad.

00:04:07.764 --> 00:04:14.104
Refer to these documents for
details on this new "Paladin" machine.

00:04:14.104 --> 00:04:18.508
As future operations will
focus around Squad 3's Paladins,

00:04:18.508 --> 00:04:23.179
even closer cooperation will be required.

00:04:23.179 --> 00:04:24.840
Sir.

00:04:26.616 --> 00:04:32.851
Is it true that you're moving
Blue outside of XAT jurisdiction?

00:04:35.692 --> 00:04:40.563
I believe that question does
not pertain to the matter at hand.

00:04:40.563 --> 00:04:42.298
I can't agree with this!

00:04:42.298 --> 00:04:45.535
We finally have a clue to who he is!

00:04:45.535 --> 00:04:48.404
At least tell us where
he's being transferred to.

00:04:48.404 --> 00:04:51.307
Where is further research
on Blue going to take place?

00:04:51.307 --> 00:04:55.211
A very classified section
you're not authorized to know about.

00:04:55.211 --> 00:04:56.746
I'll leave it at that.

00:04:56.746 --> 00:04:57.914
Then...?!

00:04:57.914 --> 00:04:59.782
Let me also warn you

00:04:59.782 --> 00:05:03.253
that any unnecessary inquiry
will likely result in charges of spying.

00:05:03.253 --> 00:05:04.354
Damn!

00:05:04.354 --> 00:05:11.094
You will focus only on the
duties given to you. That is all.

00:05:11.094 --> 00:05:15.929
Hermann, don't go causing any more problems.

00:05:20.537 --> 00:05:24.040
I'll admit, this doesn't
come as much of a surprise.

00:05:24.040 --> 00:05:26.743
What?! What the hell does that mean?!

00:05:26.743 --> 00:05:30.413
You think he should be allowed to do this?!

00:05:30.413 --> 00:05:33.249
It's not about being allowed to or not.

00:05:33.249 --> 00:05:37.887
I just assumed that things
might turn out this way eventually.

00:05:37.887 --> 00:05:38.922
Why, you...!

00:05:38.922 --> 00:05:40.823
Listen, Hermann.

00:05:40.823 --> 00:05:45.728
Do you believe this Amalgam
epidemic is just some normal disease?

00:05:45.728 --> 00:05:49.892
Don't tell me you think
it's actually the Devil's doing?

00:05:51.401 --> 00:05:55.638
Think about it. Their ability
to multiply, their adaptability...

00:05:55.638 --> 00:06:01.911
Their combat abilities even give
us top-rate soldiers a lot of trouble...

00:06:01.911 --> 00:06:05.982
There's no way those
things came about naturally.

00:06:05.982 --> 00:06:10.486
But it's a whole different story
if they were produced artificially...

00:06:10.486 --> 00:06:13.156
You're saying someone created them?!

00:06:13.156 --> 00:06:17.760
It's a lot more plausible than
being possessed by demons, at least.

00:06:17.760 --> 00:06:20.496
Technology to combine soldiers and weapons

00:06:20.496 --> 00:06:23.166
has been researched for a long time.

00:06:23.166 --> 00:06:25.401
A person able to fuse with machines

00:06:25.401 --> 00:06:28.972
is probably the ultimate form of that.

00:06:28.972 --> 00:06:31.574
You're saying they're
weapons, built by people?

00:06:31.574 --> 00:06:35.578
If they somehow got loose
and wound up out in the open,

00:06:35.578 --> 00:06:39.482
the big-shots would naturally
want no evidence left behind.

00:06:39.482 --> 00:06:43.219
We can put out the fires, but
looking for their cause is a big no-no.

00:06:43.219 --> 00:06:45.555
Besides, it's all too convenient.

00:06:45.555 --> 00:06:48.291
Take those new Paladin weapons, for example.

00:06:48.291 --> 00:06:52.161
Who made those things?
They just came out of nowhere.

00:06:52.161 --> 00:06:55.164
Where did the chief get them from?

00:06:55.164 --> 00:07:00.270
XAT getting reinforcements
at exactly this time is just too fishy.

00:07:00.270 --> 00:07:04.207
For all we know, this
could be part of a political deal.

00:07:04.207 --> 00:07:06.009
You gotta be shitting me!

00:07:06.009 --> 00:07:07.777
After all these casualties,

00:07:07.777 --> 00:07:10.747
we're not allowed to
know what the hell's going on?!

00:07:10.747 --> 00:07:13.149
What happens to the people who died, then?!

00:07:13.149 --> 00:07:15.985
Hermann, I think you got the wrong idea.

00:07:15.985 --> 00:07:16.819
What?!

00:07:16.819 --> 00:07:19.322
Revenge isn't our job.

00:07:19.322 --> 00:07:23.359
We only exterminate monsters
that threaten the citizens' livelihoods.

00:07:23.359 --> 00:07:27.597
What difference does it
make where they came from?

00:07:27.597 --> 00:07:30.633
Will knowing that stop people from dying?

00:07:30.633 --> 00:07:36.072
I dunno who the chief's
made a deal with, but I'm all for it.

00:07:36.072 --> 00:07:41.077
This new weapon and Squad 3
will make our work a lot easier.

00:07:41.077 --> 00:07:45.148
At the very least, it'll help
reduce any further casualties.

00:07:45.148 --> 00:07:47.817
You guys don't care?!

00:07:47.817 --> 00:07:50.342
Hey, Brad! Well?!

00:07:53.256 --> 00:07:54.621
Amanda!

00:08:03.066 --> 00:08:04.734
Amanda! What are you...?

00:08:04.734 --> 00:08:06.463
Don't stop me, Hermann.

00:08:07.804 --> 00:08:10.106
I'll be fine by myself from here on out.

00:08:10.106 --> 00:08:12.742
No, you won't!

00:08:12.742 --> 00:08:17.413
You're not alone! You're not the
only one who can't stomach this!

00:08:17.413 --> 00:08:18.548
Hermann...

00:08:18.548 --> 00:08:22.185
There's someone in the
lab staff I think we can talk to.

00:08:22.185 --> 00:08:25.882
Let's go. Before the chief
makes a move against us!

00:08:32.862 --> 00:08:37.433
Can you really analyze all of
Blue's data on just this machine?

00:08:37.433 --> 00:08:40.570
Normally, we would lack
the processing power for it,

00:08:40.570 --> 00:08:43.639
but tonight I can link
with Combat Research's server

00:08:43.639 --> 00:08:45.375
and distribute the workload.

00:08:45.375 --> 00:08:49.209
Huh? You have access to their server?

00:08:50.246 --> 00:08:52.248
I have XAT Squad 2's authorization,

00:08:52.248 --> 00:08:54.917
under the pretext of
using it for combat simulations.

00:08:54.917 --> 00:08:57.720
Aren't they with you?

00:08:57.720 --> 00:09:03.989
I don't know anything
at all. I ain't seen nothin'.

00:09:06.896 --> 00:09:09.432
They came through for us after all!

00:09:09.432 --> 00:09:12.833
Well, then. Shall we begin?

00:09:14.103 --> 00:09:21.077
This time we will find out who you are...

00:09:21.077 --> 00:09:25.515
Looks like they've begun.
Let's get started, too.

00:09:25.515 --> 00:09:28.117
- AI.
- Yeesh.

00:09:28.117 --> 00:09:31.554
You must really like this new weapon.

00:09:31.554 --> 00:09:33.890
You should at least check its specs.

00:09:33.890 --> 00:09:37.760
Word is we're doing a co-op
simulation with Squad 3 tonight.

00:09:37.760 --> 00:09:39.660
Alright, alright.

00:09:42.465 --> 00:09:46.369
Hey. Check out this second call sign!

00:09:46.369 --> 00:09:47.770
Clavier...

00:09:47.770 --> 00:09:50.072
Is this Lene?

00:09:50.072 --> 00:09:53.974
That's what she used in the Nine.
Don't tell me it's her?!

00:10:06.289 --> 00:10:11.461
Couldn't be. She's gotta be in the GSG9 still.

00:10:11.461 --> 00:10:17.066
I dunno. Maybe she followed
after her lover and applied for XAT.

00:10:17.066 --> 00:10:20.297
Out of the question. It's only a codename.

00:10:23.172 --> 00:10:24.696
It's just a coincidence.

00:10:28.311 --> 00:10:29.979
Oh, you're awake!

00:10:29.979 --> 00:10:31.848
Malek...

00:10:31.848 --> 00:10:37.353
Oh, me? I'm fine. I wouldn't die that easily.

00:10:37.353 --> 00:10:42.882
After all... I'm not human anymore.

00:10:45.895 --> 00:10:48.764
What do you think, Joseph? Amazing, huh?

00:10:48.764 --> 00:10:53.064
It's all thanks to you. You changed me, Joseph.

00:10:56.272 --> 00:11:01.177
It's all your fault, Joseph!

00:11:01.177 --> 00:11:05.948
The champ lost everything, too!

00:11:05.948 --> 00:11:10.783
You even... took his life!

00:11:16.859 --> 00:11:20.830
It's all your fault!

00:11:20.830 --> 00:11:22.923
Do you understand that?!

00:11:34.744 --> 00:11:36.612
- What is this?!
- What is it?

00:11:36.612 --> 00:11:40.049
There's a log of these files being copied!

00:11:40.049 --> 00:11:42.218
Someone's already copied these over!

00:11:42.218 --> 00:11:43.553
What does that mean?

00:11:43.553 --> 00:11:48.491
It's strange. Our files shouldn't
be accessible from the outside.

00:11:48.491 --> 00:11:53.596
But someone has definitely been
taking our classified data outside!

00:11:53.596 --> 00:11:56.087
Check where they accessed from!

00:12:05.241 --> 00:12:06.708
This is it.

00:12:11.013 --> 00:12:13.140
What is this?

00:12:16.319 --> 00:12:18.310
Blassreiter?

00:12:23.626 --> 00:12:28.664
This is a report put
together based on our data...

00:12:28.664 --> 00:12:32.361
Hey, isn't this Chief Victor's signature?!

00:12:35.171 --> 00:12:40.009
It's a real shame, Hermann and Amanda...

00:12:40.009 --> 00:12:41.777
Chief...

00:12:41.777 --> 00:12:44.447
This is a truly sad outcome.

00:12:44.447 --> 00:12:46.782
Take them into custody.

00:12:46.782 --> 00:12:49.717
- Let go!
- Don't resist!

00:12:52.288 --> 00:12:54.523
- Damn!
- Don't move!

00:12:54.523 --> 00:12:58.127
That's the signal to scramble!
Are you deaf or something?!

00:12:58.127 --> 00:13:00.823
Another Amalgam's shown up!

00:13:03.833 --> 00:13:06.802
You dumbass! This isn't the time!

00:13:06.802 --> 00:13:10.239
What'll happen to Al and Brad if we don't go?!

00:13:10.239 --> 00:13:14.143
Given that you've just been removed from XAT,

00:13:14.143 --> 00:13:19.048
perhaps you should be more
concerned about yourselves right now.

00:13:19.048 --> 00:13:24.620
What are you plotting, sir?
What is a Blassreiter?

00:13:24.620 --> 00:13:26.789
Take them away!

00:13:26.789 --> 00:13:30.725
Let go, dammit! Shit!

00:13:34.830 --> 00:13:37.500
What're Hermann and Amanda doing?!

00:13:37.500 --> 00:13:39.802
Don't tell me they've screwed up...

00:13:39.802 --> 00:13:40.736
It's possible.

00:13:40.736 --> 00:13:43.005
- What are you talking about?
- Oh, nothing.

00:13:43.005 --> 00:13:47.374
Captain, should we go without them?

00:13:49.879 --> 00:13:51.540
Captain?

00:13:53.249 --> 00:13:57.653
We have no choice. Let's
put Squad 1 in charge of backup.

00:13:57.653 --> 00:13:59.488
Are you serious?

00:13:59.488 --> 00:14:02.191
Dammit! Let us out!

00:14:02.191 --> 00:14:07.229
This isn't the time for this!
An Amalgam's on the loose!

00:14:07.229 --> 00:14:09.165
Why don't you understand?!

00:14:09.165 --> 00:14:10.826
Blassreiter...

00:14:21.077 --> 00:14:25.673
- Squad 1 can't hold them!
- AI! Brad! Fire!

00:14:27.049 --> 00:14:28.949
Talk about asking for too much!

00:14:32.922 --> 00:14:35.322
It's no good! They're breaking through!

00:14:45.735 --> 00:14:46.569
Crap!

00:14:46.569 --> 00:14:48.799
Brad! Run!

00:14:59.482 --> 00:15:01.279
Brad! Duck!

00:15:13.262 --> 00:15:16.365
We've arrived at the scene!

00:15:16.365 --> 00:15:19.926
XAT Squad 3, now
commencing target disposal!

00:15:26.342 --> 00:15:29.545
Geige and I will take offense!
Clavier, you cover us!

00:15:29.545 --> 00:15:31.206
Roger!

00:15:35.317 --> 00:15:37.751
That's the new weapon?!

00:15:57.306 --> 00:16:04.747
You need to understand,
Joseph! You are no longer human!

00:16:04.747 --> 00:16:06.048
You're wrong!

00:16:06.048 --> 00:16:09.752
Look at the stigmata
scar carved into your hand.

00:16:09.752 --> 00:16:13.589
That is the mark of a chosen one.

00:16:13.589 --> 00:16:15.724
There is no escape from it.

00:16:15.724 --> 00:16:19.091
No! I'm not...!

00:16:21.831 --> 00:16:26.502
Xargin-sama selected you personally.

00:16:26.502 --> 00:16:29.004
Understand what that means.

00:16:29.004 --> 00:16:33.976
You, with us, must cleanse this world.

00:16:33.976 --> 00:16:35.311
The hell with that!

00:16:35.311 --> 00:16:40.015
I'm... I'm not a monster like the rest of you!

00:16:40.015 --> 00:16:42.451
Then what about her?

00:16:42.451 --> 00:16:45.788
Now that she's been
given a miracle by your hand,

00:16:45.788 --> 00:16:50.521
she can no longer stay human.

00:16:51.527 --> 00:16:53.961
Understand now?

00:16:55.931 --> 00:16:58.200
Why do you cry?

00:16:58.200 --> 00:17:02.159
You have the power to bring about God's Word.

00:17:03.505 --> 00:17:06.742
Joseph, listen to the voice of God.

00:17:06.742 --> 00:17:09.311
The Day of Apocalypse is near.

00:17:09.311 --> 00:17:15.117
Fulfill your duty! As a chosen messenger!

00:17:15.117 --> 00:17:18.553
No! I never...

00:17:19.688 --> 00:17:24.091
My sister never wanted this!

00:17:27.963 --> 00:17:30.766
Squad 3 is on the scene!

00:17:30.766 --> 00:17:34.937
One Amalgam is destroyed.
The other is fleeing toward 02!

00:17:34.937 --> 00:17:36.839
Target has sustained right-side injuries!

00:17:36.839 --> 00:17:40.866
It may attempt to fuse
with mobile heavy machinery!

00:18:01.830 --> 00:18:03.730
Whoa...

00:18:06.135 --> 00:18:07.336
Operation complete!

00:18:07.336 --> 00:18:09.805
Geige and Senger,
proceed to confirm situation!

00:18:09.805 --> 00:18:10.965
Roger!

00:18:43.672 --> 00:18:44.974
Lene Rosamunde!

00:18:44.974 --> 00:18:48.644
I've been assigned to XAT
Squad 3, effective today!

00:18:48.644 --> 00:18:50.305
I'm glad to work with you.

00:18:51.447 --> 00:18:52.778
You're...

00:18:54.550 --> 00:18:57.451
I look forward to working with you, Sempai.

00:19:30.152 --> 00:19:33.722
What's... What's going to happen to me?

00:19:33.722 --> 00:19:38.527
Am I... going to die too? Just like the others?

00:19:38.527 --> 00:19:44.266
Will I turn into a monster...
be hunted down... and killed?

00:19:44.266 --> 00:19:48.670
That depends entirely on you.

00:19:48.670 --> 00:19:51.607
You are a messenger chosen by God.

00:19:51.607 --> 00:19:55.411
Fulfill your duty on the coming
Day of Apocalypse, and perhaps...

00:19:55.411 --> 00:19:58.812
What's going to happen?

00:20:06.955 --> 00:20:12.061
What's going to happen to this world?

00:20:12.061 --> 00:20:18.591
Sure. I'll show you.

00:20:19.735 --> 00:20:24.138
The inexpiable end days of Babylon...

00:20:53.402 --> 00:20:57.673
Will you be able to reach that echelon?

00:20:57.673 --> 00:20:59.675
Can you prove you have the power

00:20:59.675 --> 00:21:03.512
to subjugate the Underworld and rule death?

00:21:03.512 --> 00:21:06.081
P-Power? It's about power?

00:21:06.081 --> 00:21:07.516
That's right.

00:21:07.516 --> 00:21:12.421
All you need is power for God
to show His anger through you.

00:21:12.421 --> 00:21:16.255
And then the prophecy of the
Apocalypse will come to pass.

00:21:47.089 --> 00:21:54.963
The ever-flowing songs search my memory

00:21:54.963 --> 00:22:07.075
The pain etched out by the
times slowly brings me back

00:22:07.075 --> 00:22:10.312
Embrace the sadness

00:22:10.312 --> 00:22:17.753
I know, the days that have passed by

00:22:17.753 --> 00:22:22.257
When I look up, it doesn't spill down

00:22:22.257 --> 00:22:28.830
As it trickles down the window,
sad rain rattles the heated isolation

00:22:28.830 --> 00:22:34.203
Tonight I will be forsaken by sleep

00:22:34.203 --> 00:22:42.010
It's almost as if I'm traveling
to a country no one's ever heard of

00:22:42.010 --> 00:22:48.350
I'm all alone, and my words
don't get through to anyone

00:22:48.350 --> 00:22:50.419
Wow wow

00:22:50.419 --> 00:22:58.427
Now my heart is frozen and waiting

00:22:58.427 --> 00:23:05.526
because it wants a phone
call so it can connect with you

00:23:13.942 --> 00:23:16.478
The sound of the messenger's horn resonates.

00:23:16.478 --> 00:23:21.416
From the unbolted gates of Hell
comes an army of the Underworld.

00:23:21.416 --> 00:23:25.787
Episode 11: "Prelude to Apocalypse."

00:23:25.787 --> 00:23:30.315
Amid the burning rain of sulfur,
XAT's greatest ordeal looms.
